sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen as Complainant
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (main.py)
    participant Engine as Complaint Structuring Engine
    participant PDF as ReportLab PDF Generator
    participant Mail as Email Routing Service
    participant Repo as Async PostgreSQL Repository
    participant Officer as Police Station / Human Reviewer

    Citizen->>UI: Submit complaint narrative & location
    UI->>API: POST /complaint/compile
    API->>Engine: run_structuring(request)
    Engine-->>API: Structured Report (facts, jurisdiction, review_route)

    opt Compile Official PDF Draft
        API->>PDF: generate_complaint_pdf(report, language="en/hi/mr")
        PDF-->>API: Binary PDF Buffer (Bilingual formatting, official disclaimers)
        API->>Repo: store_document_version(complaint_id, pdf_bytes, sha256)
        Repo-->>API: document_version_id
    end

    opt Prepare Station Dispatch Email
        API->>Mail: draft_station_email(report, station_name, document_version_id)
        Mail-->>API: EmailDraft (to: ps.station.mum@mahapolice.gov.in)
        API->>Repo: store_email_draft(complaint_id, email_draft)
        Repo-->>API: draft_id
    end

    API->>Repo: record_audit_event(action="complaint_compiled", actor="system_engine")
    Repo-->>API: audit_event_id

    API-->>UI: Response Payload (Report, PDF Download URL, Station Email Preview)
    UI-->>Citizen: Display structured draft, officer checklist, and disclaimer notice

    alt If review_route == "ready_for_police_review"
        Citizen->>UI: Review & Confirm submission
        UI->>Officer: Dispatch formal draft email to local police station
    else If review_route == "human_review_required"
        UI-->>Citizen: Prompt for missing facts / Advise personal station visit
        UI->>Officer: Queue for manual desk officer inquiry
    end
